{"text": "His wife, who was in despair, came to the prison with their small children, and when she saw him in chains among criminals, she fainted. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She told him that her petition to the Czar had been refused, and she reminded him sadly of her dream about his gray hair. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then, running her fingers through his hair, she said, Vanya dearest, tell your wife the truth, Was it not you who did it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So you, too, suspect me, cried Aksionov, and hiding his face in his hands, he began to weep. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When his family had gone for the last time, he thought, Only God can know the truth, and only from Him can I expect mercy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He wrote no more petitions and only prayed to God, and he was later whipped and sent to Siberia with other prisoners. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Twenty six years passed in Siberia, his hair turning as white as snow and his beard growing long, thin, and gray. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All his cheerfulness was gone, and he walked slowly with a stooped back, spoke little, never laughed, and often prayed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He learned to make boots in prison, and the other prisoners, who respected his gentleness, called him Grandfather and the Saint.", "alignment": {"characters": ["H", "i", "s", " ", "w", "i", "f", "e", ",", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "i", "n", " ", "d", "e", "s", "p", "a", "i", "r", ",", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "r", "i", "s", "o", "n", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "t", "h", "e", "i", "r", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", " ", "c", "h", "i", "l", "d", "r", "e", "n", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "h", "e", "n", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "w", " ", "h", "i", "m", " ", "i", "n", " ", "c", "h", "a", "i", "n", "s", " ", "a", "m", "o", "n", "g", " ", "c", "r", "i", "m", "i", "n", "a", "l", "s", ",", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "f", "a", "i", "n", "t", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<",